  ✕ Cannot reassign variable while taking its reference
   ╭─[test.lis:6:3]
 5 │   let mut a = Node { kids: [], next: None }
 6 │   a = Node { kids: [&a], next: None }
   ·   ─────────────────┬─────────────────
   ·                    ╰── disallowed
 7 │   let _ = a
   ╰────
  help: Separate the reassignment from reference taking, or use a different variable · code: [infer.self_reference_in_assignment]
